<title>TURKEY: Tofas 1997-99 investment plan $262 mln.</title>
<headline>Tofas 1997-99 investment plan $262 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's leading car maker Tofas Turk Otomobil Fabrikasi A.S. said it planned to spend a total of $262 million on investments in the 1997-1999 period.</p>
<p>In a statement sent to the Istanbul Stock Exchange, the company said the spending was approved by its partners, Turkish Koc Holding and Italian Fiat SpA.</p>
<p>Koc and Fiat each hold a 37.86 percent stake in Tofas.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875</p>
</text>
